{ "data": { "text": "Correlation matrices comparing all 90 regions of the 14-network Stanford atlas (Shirer et al., 2012) were extracted for each participant in each group. These matrices were then exported into MATLAB (math works.com) and analyzed using the Brain Connectivity Toolbox (Rubinov and Sporns, 2010). Each network statistic was computed at a range of correlation thresholds from r ¼ 0.05 to r ¼ 0.5. Individual participants ' measures of degrees, clustering coef /uniFB01 cients, strengths, betweenness centrality, and local ef /uniFB01 ciency, were calculated for each region in each brain and then averaged across participants for each group, whereas modularity was a single measure for the whole brain that was calculated for each participant. These group averages were then compared using one-way ANOVAs to determine group differences in each network measure while correcting for false-discovery rate of 0.05 for comparisons across 6 network measures (Benjamini-Hochberg, 1995)." }, "annotations": [ { "result": [ { "from_name": "Atlas definition", "to_name": "text", "type": "labels", "value": { "start": 100, "end": 120, "text": "14-network Stanford atlas", "labels": [ "Atlas definition — Parameters" ] } }, { "from_name": "Atlas definition", "to_name": "text", "type": "labels", "value": { "start": 121, "end": 127, "text": "atlas", "labels": [ "Atlas definition — Step Number" ] } }, { "from_name": "Compute connectivity", "to_name": "text", "type": "labels", "value": { "start": 150, "end": 165, "text": "Correlation matrices", "labels": [ "Compute connectivity — Algorithm" ] } }, { "from_name": "Graph measures", "to_name": "text", "type": "labels", "value": { "start": 180, "end": 195, "text": "degrees", "labels": [ "Graph measures — Parameters" ] } }, { "from_name": "Graph measures", "to_name": "text", "type": "labels", "value": { "start": 200, "end": 215, "text": "clustering coef /uniFB01 cients", "labels": [ "Graph measures — Parameters" ] } }, { "from_name": "Graph measures", "to_name": "text", "type": "labels", "value": { "start": 220, "end": 235, "text": "strengths", "labels": [ "Graph measures — Parameters" ] } }, { "from_name": "Graph measures", "to_name": "text", "type": "labels", "value": { "start": 240, "end": 255, "text": "betweenness centrality", "labels": [ "Graph measures — Parameters" ] } }, { "from_name": "Graph measures", "to_name": "text", "type": "labels", "value": { "start": 260, "end": 275, "text": "local ef /uniFB01 ciency", "labels": [ "Graph measures — Parameters" ] } }, { "from_name": "Graph measures", "to_name": "text", "type": "labels", "value": { "start": 280, "end": 295, "text": "modularity", "labels": [ "Graph measures — Parameters" ] } }, { "from_name": "Sparsity control", "to_name": "text", "type": "labels", "value": { "start": 310, "end": 325, "text": "correlation thresholds from r ¼ 0.05 to r ¼ 0.5", "labels": [ "Sparsity control — Parameters" ] } }, { "from_name": "Graph measures", "to_name": "text", "type": "labels", "value": { "start": 340, "end": 355, "text": "one-way ANOVAs", "labels": [ "Graph measures — Algorithm" ] } }, { "from_name": "Graph measures", "to_name": "text", "type": "labels", "value": { "start": 360, "end": 375, "text": "false-discovery rate of 0.05", "labels": [ "Graph measures — Parameters" ] } }, { "from_name": "Graph measures", "to_name": "text", "type": "labels", "value": { "start": 380, "end": 395, "text": "Benjamini-Hochberg", "labels": [ "Graph measures — Algorithm" ] } }, { "from_name": "Graph measures", "to_name": "text", "type": "labels", "value": { "start": 400, "end": 415, "text": "group averages", "labels": [ "Graph measures — Step Number" ] } } ] } ] }